{"synopsis":"Setelah melakukan perjalanan melalui ruang dan waktu dan menjadi penjahat berambut kuning pada tahap awal novel protagonis wanita tertentu, Moon mengatakan bahwa ia hanya ingin hidup dengan baik. Tapi, perkembangan cerita sepertinya sedikit salah? Sang putri dibius dan celananya dilepas, tetapi mengapa protagonis belum tiba? Mengapa kekasih masa kecil protagonis, santa yang mulia dan suci, sering menggoda saya? Bahkan pelayan yang patuh dan berperilaku baik telah menatapku dengan tatapan berbahaya baru-baru ini! Di mana protagonisnya? Sang protagonis, tolong selamatkan dia !! “Haha, kamu harus bertanggung jawab untuk merampok wanitaku ~” Protagonis protagonis wanita berkata dengan senyum ramah, memegang kapak di tangannya.","alternative_title":"凤傲天小说里的黄毛反派也想幸福","author":"Zi Yu Wo Fei Yu, 菠萝包轻小说","artist":"菠萝包轻小说","chapters":[{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"da983295-eb44-4873-bcf0-c824737fdd5f","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"2d653920-b752-4f82-8706-3248a884edec","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"0e508843-caf0-47b8-9720-4f68701e7655","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"99adb9d3-656c-4c3a-8a07-65250105f0fe","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"a2ad815b-1ccb-4e4f-928f-08ef5fd50d76","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"cf150d8b-8235-47a0-bf8a-c966b4da77d9","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"a11c21a8-3192-43fa-b8da-edc41ea2a1b9","date":"2026-06-15","images":[]},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"371aa9b4-577a-4fea-81b8-14a261c84919","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"c32c37e4-ce67-409e-bef8-27d403ac43f8","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"d1da832e-c161-4423-8165-b828f8af7a23","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"70","chapter":"70","slug":"0a9bf692-12c1-47fe-ab1